00:01:32.246 --> 00:01:35.584
=Flying Up Without Disturb=

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.976
=Episode 22=

00:01:41.402 --> 00:01:42.842
I ran out of water.

00:01:42.842 --> 00:01:44.083
Can I have some water here?

00:01:44.243 --> 00:01:46.002
Why don't you ask your neighbor?

00:01:46.002 --> 00:01:46.922
It's much closer.

00:02:08.242 --> 00:02:09.482
What do you want again?

00:02:09.603 --> 00:02:11.003
Could I borrow your lamp?

00:02:11.003 --> 00:02:11.762
Mine went out.

00:02:11.762 --> 00:02:12.482
Or I can sit

00:02:12.482 --> 00:02:13.123
for a while.

00:02:13.123 --> 00:02:14.283
It's daytime.

00:02:14.283 --> 00:02:15.403
Who needs lamps now?

00:02:25.883 --> 00:02:27.082
Lady Ling Bo.

00:02:28.163 --> 00:02:29.202
You startled me.

00:02:29.202 --> 00:02:30.163
What do you want again?

00:02:30.163 --> 00:02:31.682
My room smells terrible.

00:02:31.762 --> 00:02:32.642
Yours smells so nice.

00:02:32.642 --> 00:02:33.682
What incense do you use?

00:02:33.802 --> 00:02:34.642
My room smells nice

00:02:34.642 --> 00:02:35.762
because of me.

00:02:35.762 --> 00:02:36.522
Your room stinks

00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:37.642
because you stink.

00:02:38.283 --> 00:02:39.082
Will you leave?

00:02:45.843 --> 00:02:47.003
Lady Ling Bo.

00:02:48.403 --> 00:02:49.843
Lady Ling Bo.

00:02:55.242 --> 00:02:55.802
I don't know

00:02:55.802 --> 00:02:57.163
if my legs are hurting

00:02:57.443 --> 00:02:58.603
whenever I walk

00:02:58.603 --> 00:02:59.802
because I've lost my tail.

00:02:59.922 --> 00:03:01.403
Shall I massage them for you?

00:03:02.283 --> 00:03:03.283
Isn't it improper?

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:04.723
In your dreams.

00:03:04.723 --> 00:03:06.082
Why did you mention your tail?

00:03:06.082 --> 00:03:06.843
It infuriates me.

00:03:06.843 --> 00:03:07.443
Ouch!

00:03:07.603 --> 00:03:08.242
I'm warning you.

00:03:08.242 --> 00:03:09.482
Stay away from my room.

00:03:09.482 --> 00:03:10.283
Or I'll

00:03:10.283 --> 00:03:11.163
personally pluck out

00:03:11.163 --> 00:03:12.283
your newly grown fox tail.

00:03:13.443 --> 00:03:14.003
Come on.

00:03:14.123 --> 00:03:15.723
Fine, I won't go in.

00:03:15.922 --> 00:03:17.482
You're so heartless.

00:03:47.962 --> 00:03:49.403
Did you make a wish?

00:03:50.883 --> 00:03:52.003
I wished for...

00:03:52.802 --> 00:03:54.283
Don't say it out loud.

00:03:54.283 --> 00:03:56.043
Or it won't come true.

00:03:58.082 --> 00:03:58.582
Alright.

00:03:59.403 --> 00:04:01.202
I'll give you a gift, then.

00:04:02.723 --> 00:04:03.682
What is it?

00:04:12.323 --> 00:04:14.642
It contains your spiritual energy?

00:04:14.642 --> 00:04:15.202
Yeah.

00:04:17.882 --> 00:04:19.002
I remember

00:04:19.002 --> 00:04:21.242
that Tan Feng once gave me a bracelet,

00:04:21.242 --> 00:04:22.203
claiming it was yours.

00:04:22.203 --> 00:04:23.922
I treasured it for so long.

00:04:24.002 --> 00:04:25.523
Now, not only does this bracelet

00:04:25.523 --> 00:04:26.362
belong to me,

00:04:26.843 --> 00:04:29.643
but Master Zhong Xi is mine too.

00:04:36.922 --> 00:04:37.523
Yeah.

00:04:39.322 --> 00:04:40.403
(Master Zhong Xi)

00:04:40.403 --> 00:04:41.362
(will be entirely yours)

00:04:43.763 --> 00:04:44.882
(and yours alone.)

00:04:56.802 --> 00:04:57.922
I promise

00:04:58.203 --> 00:05:00.322
this will be the most magnificent

00:05:00.322 --> 00:05:02.763
bridal headpiece in Lingyou Realm.

00:05:02.882 --> 00:05:04.242
Elder Qiu Shuang.

00:05:04.322 --> 00:05:05.562
It's indeed

00:05:05.562 --> 00:05:06.723
magnificent,

00:05:06.723 --> 00:05:08.203
but all this glittering gold

00:05:08.203 --> 00:05:08.843
is too...

00:05:09.763 --> 00:05:11.802
Elder, please spare me.

00:05:11.802 --> 00:05:13.083
I can't wear this.

00:05:13.203 --> 00:05:15.083
It's too much.

00:05:15.963 --> 00:05:18.242
Should I make it plainer?

00:05:18.882 --> 00:05:20.203
That'd be better.

00:05:20.322 --> 00:05:21.122
Kong Hou.

00:05:22.002 --> 00:05:22.643
Wait.

00:05:22.643 --> 00:05:24.322
Zhong Xi, I'm here.

00:05:28.242 --> 00:05:29.882
The groom can't see the bride

00:05:29.882 --> 00:05:31.643
before the bonding ceremony.

00:05:31.643 --> 00:05:32.482
It's a tradition.

00:05:32.482 --> 00:05:33.763
Greetings, Elder Qiu Shuang.

00:05:33.963 --> 00:05:34.562
Is Kong Hou...

00:05:34.562 --> 00:05:35.922
Kong Hou is perfectly fine.

00:05:36.043 --> 00:05:37.643
I promise your dear Kong Hou

00:05:37.643 --> 00:05:38.882
will be the prettiest bride

00:05:38.882 --> 00:05:41.083
in the Lingyou Realm.

00:05:41.562 --> 00:05:42.682
Hurry up and leave.

00:05:42.802 --> 00:05:43.603
Thank you.

00:05:43.723 --> 00:05:44.682
I take my leave.

00:05:45.682 --> 00:05:46.843
Let's try again.

00:05:55.882 --> 00:05:57.122
Elder Qiu Shuang.

00:05:57.283 --> 00:06:00.523
This one is too plain, right?

00:06:02.482 --> 00:06:03.242
Let's try again.

00:06:06.603 --> 00:06:07.403
Again.

00:06:08.242 --> 00:06:09.283
Again.

00:06:22.163 --> 00:06:23.122
You startled me.

00:06:23.122 --> 00:06:24.403
Y-You startled me!

00:06:24.403 --> 00:06:25.283
Enough.

00:06:25.283 --> 00:06:25.963
I've been

00:06:25.963 --> 00:06:26.643
looking for you.

00:06:26.643 --> 00:06:27.682
I... You...

00:06:27.682 --> 00:06:29.163
Y-You are looking for me?

00:06:29.723 --> 00:06:31.242
D-Didn't you tell me

00:06:31.362 --> 00:06:32.723
to stay away from you

00:06:32.723 --> 00:06:34.163
forever?

00:06:34.482 --> 00:06:35.442
Do me a favor.

00:06:36.203 --> 00:06:36.763
What's wrong?

00:06:36.963 --> 00:06:37.882
It sounds serious.

00:06:38.523 --> 00:06:39.023
Let's go.

00:06:39.562 --> 00:06:40.643
Wait, what is it?

00:06:42.043 --> 00:06:42.882
So,

00:06:43.362 --> 00:06:45.242
this is the "serious" matter?

00:06:45.523 --> 00:06:46.682
Get it away.

00:06:46.682 --> 00:06:47.643
Alright.

00:06:47.643 --> 00:06:48.442
Go away.

00:06:49.922 --> 00:06:51.283
Come on, it was cute.

00:06:51.723 --> 00:06:53.043
It's gone.

00:06:53.362 --> 00:06:55.163
If there's nothing else,

00:06:55.283 --> 00:06:56.603
I'll take my leave.

00:06:56.603 --> 00:06:57.482
Wait.

00:06:58.882 --> 00:07:00.802
Check around to make sure

00:07:00.802 --> 00:07:01.802
there's none left.

00:07:04.682 --> 00:07:05.882
Who would've thought

00:07:05.963 --> 00:07:07.043
that the fearless

00:07:07.043 --> 00:07:07.802
Lady Ling Bo

00:07:07.802 --> 00:07:09.362
is scared of a tiny insect?

00:07:09.362 --> 00:07:10.682
Don't laugh at me.

00:07:11.802 --> 00:07:12.603
Alright.

00:07:12.603 --> 00:07:13.603
I'll look around

00:07:14.442 --> 00:07:15.362
so that you can

00:07:15.362 --> 00:07:16.562
have a nice sleep.

00:07:23.562 --> 00:07:24.523
Nothing here.

00:07:31.442 --> 00:07:32.122
Found anything?

00:07:32.403 --> 00:07:33.203
Clear here.

00:07:36.882 --> 00:07:38.723
Check the bed.

00:07:41.163 --> 00:07:42.362
On the bed?

00:07:49.802 --> 00:07:50.643
Nothing, right?

00:07:50.802 --> 00:07:51.523
Nothing here.

00:07:52.322 --> 00:07:53.482
Good to know.

00:07:53.482 --> 00:07:54.843
I can rest easy tonight.

00:07:56.002 --> 00:07:56.843
What's wrong?

00:07:57.562 --> 00:07:58.242
What?

00:07:58.362 --> 00:07:59.843
You're so annoying.

00:07:59.882 --> 00:08:01.482
Look around again.

00:08:02.242 --> 00:08:03.802
Don't move.

00:08:03.802 --> 00:08:04.603
- Where is it?
- Stay still.

00:08:22.002 --> 00:08:23.562
There is one here.

00:08:27.083 --> 00:08:29.723
I-I think they're all gone now.

00:08:29.843 --> 00:08:31.002
If you see another one,

00:08:31.083 --> 00:08:31.763
maybe

00:08:31.763 --> 00:08:33.243
you can call me again.

00:08:34.602 --> 00:08:35.562
I'll leave now.

00:08:37.483 --> 00:08:38.322
Thanks.

00:08:49.842 --> 00:08:50.883
Alright, Kong Hou.

00:08:51.003 --> 00:08:51.922
Go back and rest.

00:08:51.962 --> 00:08:52.922
I've lived here

00:08:52.922 --> 00:08:54.403
for over a thousand years.

00:08:54.602 --> 00:08:56.602
I could find my way back blindfolded.

00:08:58.003 --> 00:08:58.962
Tomorrow,

00:08:59.003 --> 00:09:00.322
you'll become a bride.

00:09:00.363 --> 00:09:01.643
Get some rest.

00:09:01.763 --> 00:09:02.523
Thank you

00:09:02.562 --> 00:09:04.202
for everything, Elder Qiu Shuang.

00:09:12.802 --> 00:09:13.523
Kong Hou.

00:09:15.722 --> 00:09:17.283
Didn't you leave?

00:09:17.403 --> 00:09:18.842
Why did you come back?

00:09:19.043 --> 00:09:21.322
Or you never left?

00:09:21.442 --> 00:09:22.442
I wanted to see you.

00:09:22.922 --> 00:09:24.763
We just met this morning.

00:09:29.403 --> 00:09:31.163
I want to see you properly.

00:09:32.082 --> 00:09:34.322
Elder Qiu Shuang did my trial makeup

00:09:34.322 --> 00:09:35.962
and made my cheeks red.

00:09:35.962 --> 00:09:36.883
I'm not pretty.

00:09:37.922 --> 00:09:38.602
You are.

00:09:41.123 --> 00:09:42.682
The storybooks say

00:09:42.682 --> 00:09:44.322
that men's sweet words

00:09:44.483 --> 00:09:45.842
can't be trusted.

00:09:46.043 --> 00:09:47.562
One day,

00:09:47.562 --> 00:09:49.643
you may get tired of me.

00:09:51.883 --> 00:09:53.922
That day will never come.

00:09:54.483 --> 00:09:55.082
Really?

00:09:55.163 --> 00:09:55.922
Yeah.

00:09:57.922 --> 00:09:59.003
But what if

00:09:59.003 --> 00:10:00.483
you get tired of me one day?

00:10:00.802 --> 00:10:01.922
No way.

00:10:02.043 --> 00:10:03.883
I'll never get tired of you.

00:10:05.763 --> 00:10:06.403
Pinky swear.

00:10:07.962 --> 00:10:08.562
Pinky swear.

00:10:08.962 --> 00:10:09.922
We vow to never

00:10:09.962 --> 00:10:11.523
grow weary of each other.

00:10:11.523 --> 00:10:12.842
We shall remain

00:10:12.883 --> 00:10:13.962
as we are now.

00:10:33.322 --> 00:10:35.123
The Zhaohan Sect leader
failed the tribulation

00:10:35.123 --> 00:10:36.562
and might not make it.

00:10:37.842 --> 00:10:38.682
Xiao Dong.

00:10:38.682 --> 00:10:39.842
What did you say?

00:10:40.322 --> 00:10:42.363
What about the Zhaohan Sect leader?

00:10:42.523 --> 00:10:43.562
Who knows?

00:10:43.602 --> 00:10:44.802
Everyone is saying

00:10:44.802 --> 00:10:46.483
that the head of the Zhaohan Sect

00:10:46.682 --> 00:10:48.322
failed the tribulation

00:10:48.322 --> 00:10:50.123
and might not even survive.

00:10:50.562 --> 00:10:51.842
When did this happen?

00:10:52.523 --> 00:10:53.763
Why haven't I heard about it?

00:10:53.883 --> 00:10:55.562
Their sect members are discussing

00:10:55.643 --> 00:10:56.202
the succession

00:10:56.202 --> 00:10:57.763
of the new sect leader.

00:10:57.883 --> 00:10:59.363
Wouldn't that be Lady Ling Bo?

00:10:59.363 --> 00:11:00.163
Says who?

00:11:00.163 --> 00:11:01.722
She lacks the cultivation

00:11:01.722 --> 00:11:03.322
to assume the position of sect leader.

00:11:03.643 --> 00:11:05.682
But isn't the successor

00:11:05.962 --> 00:11:07.883
usually the chief disciple?

00:11:07.922 --> 00:11:10.283
Then it should be Chang De.

00:11:10.442 --> 00:11:11.403
Not just "should",

00:11:11.403 --> 00:11:12.322
it's certain.

00:11:13.123 --> 00:11:13.962
I heard that

00:11:14.003 --> 00:11:14.802
Chang De is already

00:11:14.802 --> 00:11:15.883
preparing to take over.

00:11:16.883 --> 00:11:18.523
(If Ling Bo can't inherit the position,)

00:11:19.082 --> 00:11:20.202
(what's the point of me)

00:11:20.202 --> 00:11:21.163
(pursuing her?)

00:11:24.043 --> 00:11:24.802
Back then,

00:11:25.442 --> 00:11:27.283
when her master was still recovering,

00:11:28.403 --> 00:11:30.082
I chose to cut ties with her.

00:11:33.442 --> 00:11:35.202
She probably won't talk to me again.

00:11:36.003 --> 00:11:36.883
Xiao Dong.

00:11:39.763 --> 00:11:42.403
I'm quite bothered. Let's talk.

00:11:43.363 --> 00:11:44.403
I love hearing

00:11:44.602 --> 00:11:45.883
other people's troubles.

00:11:45.883 --> 00:11:47.163
Tell me everything.

00:11:47.163 --> 00:11:48.322
Look how thrilled you are.

00:11:49.043 --> 00:11:50.003
Well...

00:11:51.003 --> 00:11:51.722
I'll tell you,

00:11:51.962 --> 00:11:53.243
but you mustn't tell a soul.

00:11:53.243 --> 00:11:54.363
Don't worry.

00:11:54.363 --> 00:11:55.043
My lips

00:11:55.043 --> 00:11:57.043
are sealed tight.

00:11:57.643 --> 00:11:58.643
Here's the thing.

00:11:59.403 --> 00:12:01.003
I recently encountered

00:12:01.763 --> 00:12:03.763
a lady I once admired.

00:12:03.883 --> 00:12:06.883
A lady you once admired?

00:12:08.082 --> 00:12:09.602
You've fallen for someone?

00:12:11.322 --> 00:12:13.562
We drifted apart for some reason.

00:12:15.883 --> 00:12:17.043
So you're saying

00:12:17.043 --> 00:12:17.922
that you've

00:12:17.922 --> 00:12:18.562
rediscovered

00:12:18.562 --> 00:12:20.523
your feelings for her now?

00:12:22.842 --> 00:12:23.962
You could put it that way.

00:12:24.202 --> 00:12:25.643
Then what's the problem?

00:12:25.643 --> 00:12:26.523
Just talk to her.

00:12:26.523 --> 00:12:27.043
Ask her

00:12:27.043 --> 00:12:27.883
whether you can

00:12:27.883 --> 00:12:28.643
start over.

00:12:29.283 --> 00:12:30.442
She won't say yes.

00:12:30.523 --> 00:12:31.123
Why not?

00:12:33.023 --> 00:12:33.523
She gave me

00:12:33.523 --> 00:12:34.523
a jade pendant.

00:12:34.722 --> 00:12:36.043
But after we met this time,

00:12:36.043 --> 00:12:36.883
she wouldn't

00:12:36.883 --> 00:12:38.043
let me wear it.

00:12:38.163 --> 00:12:38.922
Obviously,

00:12:38.922 --> 00:12:40.123
you broke her heart.

00:12:42.363 --> 00:12:44.643
I had no choice back then.

00:12:45.123 --> 00:12:46.562
"No choice," my foot.

00:12:46.883 --> 00:12:47.602
Anyway,

00:12:47.722 --> 00:12:49.523
that's all in the past now.

00:12:50.922 --> 00:12:52.043
It was my fault.

00:12:53.962 --> 00:12:56.163
Don't be too hard on yourself

00:12:56.163 --> 00:12:57.163
for that.

00:12:57.283 --> 00:12:59.082
T-Think about it.

00:12:59.082 --> 00:13:00.922
After you met her the other day,

00:13:01.043 --> 00:13:02.322
how was she with you?

00:13:02.322 --> 00:13:03.722
When she told you to

00:13:03.722 --> 00:13:05.883
remove the pendant, was she harsh?

00:13:06.883 --> 00:13:07.763
A little.

00:13:07.763 --> 00:13:09.322
That's good news.

00:13:09.842 --> 00:13:11.123
That's good news?

00:13:11.562 --> 00:13:12.403
What do you mean?

00:13:12.403 --> 00:13:14.163
The fact that she's harsh

00:13:14.163 --> 00:13:14.842
proves that

00:13:14.842 --> 00:13:16.562
she still cares about you.

00:13:16.562 --> 00:13:17.602
If she didn't care,

00:13:17.602 --> 00:13:18.643
she wouldn't even

00:13:18.643 --> 00:13:19.523
mention it.

00:13:20.962 --> 00:13:22.403
So you think she still

00:13:22.962 --> 00:13:23.962
has feelings for me?

00:13:24.163 --> 00:13:25.202
- Yeah.
- We could

00:13:25.202 --> 00:13:26.403
get back together?

00:13:26.403 --> 00:13:27.562
That's right.

00:13:34.003 --> 00:13:35.043
Wait.

00:13:35.483 --> 00:13:38.243
If she's harsh with me,

00:13:38.483 --> 00:13:39.082
doesn't it mean

00:13:39.082 --> 00:13:40.082
she's holding a grudge?

00:13:40.082 --> 00:13:41.243
Of course,

00:13:41.243 --> 00:13:42.243
she is mad at you.

00:13:42.243 --> 00:13:42.922
She's hurt

00:13:42.922 --> 00:13:44.602
and has every right to be upset.

00:13:44.682 --> 00:13:46.043
How did we end up in a loop?

00:13:46.043 --> 00:13:47.163
I'm more confused now.

00:13:47.163 --> 00:13:48.922
Come on, why are you confused?

00:13:48.922 --> 00:13:50.363
Look, you broke her heart.

00:13:50.363 --> 00:13:51.922
That becomes a trauma for her.

00:13:51.922 --> 00:13:53.643
You need to heal her

00:13:53.643 --> 00:13:54.602
before anything.

00:13:56.243 --> 00:13:58.043
Then tell me.

00:13:58.403 --> 00:13:59.403
What should I do?

00:13:59.763 --> 00:14:00.763
If you ask me,

00:14:00.763 --> 00:14:02.922
you should go to her right now

00:14:02.922 --> 00:14:04.523
and confess your love.

00:14:04.722 --> 00:14:06.483
If she tells you to stay away,

00:14:06.483 --> 00:14:07.722
you must get closer.

00:14:07.722 --> 00:14:08.442
Even if she says,

00:14:08.442 --> 00:14:09.123
"Get lost,"

00:14:09.123 --> 00:14:09.763
you should...

00:14:10.123 --> 00:14:11.283
Stop laughing. I'm serious.

00:14:11.283 --> 00:14:12.883
Stay there even if she tells you to die.

00:14:12.883 --> 00:14:14.483
You must take the initiative

00:14:14.483 --> 00:14:15.763
to express your love.

00:14:15.763 --> 00:14:17.403
Show your sincerity

00:14:17.403 --> 00:14:18.243
and devotion.

00:14:18.763 --> 00:14:20.283
Even if she told me to get lost,

00:14:20.283 --> 00:14:21.363
I shouldn't leave?

00:14:21.363 --> 00:14:21.962
Yeah.

00:14:22.163 --> 00:14:22.763
Alright.

00:14:22.763 --> 00:14:23.562
You have a point.

00:14:23.562 --> 00:14:24.802
Obviously.

00:14:24.962 --> 00:14:26.483
Don't you know who I am?

00:14:26.602 --> 00:14:28.003
But, Lin Hu.

00:14:28.283 --> 00:14:29.763
You know, some people

00:14:29.763 --> 00:14:32.043
are all talk and no action.

00:14:32.243 --> 00:14:33.802
They lecture others like experts.

00:14:33.802 --> 00:14:35.283
But when it comes to themselves,

00:14:35.283 --> 00:14:36.043
they fail.

00:14:37.043 --> 00:14:38.322
Wait, what are you implying?

00:14:38.322 --> 00:14:39.003
Look.

00:14:39.043 --> 00:14:40.483
I've known you for years.

00:14:40.763 --> 00:14:41.602
I've never

00:14:41.602 --> 00:14:42.883
seen you dating anyone.

00:14:43.842 --> 00:14:45.202
I'm here to comfort you.

00:14:45.202 --> 00:14:46.403
And you mock me?

00:14:46.722 --> 00:14:47.322
I'm done.

00:14:47.322 --> 00:14:48.163
I'm going to bed.

00:14:48.523 --> 00:14:51.602
Oh, and act quickly.

00:14:51.722 --> 00:14:52.322
I'm off.

00:14:52.643 --> 00:14:53.842
Got it.

00:14:56.403 --> 00:14:57.962
Act quickly.

00:15:00.082 --> 00:15:02.003
Should I listen to him or not?

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:05.018
(Yunhua Sect)

00:15:20.442 --> 00:15:25.025
♪Waiting for time to slow♪

00:15:28.648 --> 00:15:33.217
♪Oceans turn to dust in mere moments♪

00:15:36.529 --> 00:15:39.685
♪Dreams are fleeting and brief♪

00:15:40.657 --> 00:15:43.800
♪Fade like a poem♪

00:15:44.425 --> 00:15:50.904
♪Fate holds us apart♪

00:15:51.514 --> 00:15:55.932
♪Stars stream in your eyes♪

00:15:56.265 --> 00:16:00.156
♪Intoxicated, I linger
and forget to return♪

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:08.346
♪All worldly things
and gentle breezes become futile♪

00:16:08.538 --> 00:16:12.555
♪Temples await the moonlight's fall♪

00:16:12.828 --> 00:16:16.652
♪Time engraves into rings♪

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:24.154
♪Slowly, we accompany the fading lights♪

00:16:45.643 --> 00:16:47.442
The auspicious hour has come.

00:16:51.432 --> 00:16:56.001
♪Oceans turn to dust in mere moments♪

00:16:59.313 --> 00:17:02.469
♪Dreams are fleeting and brief♪

00:17:03.441 --> 00:17:06.584
♪Fade like a poem♪

00:17:07.209 --> 00:17:13.688
♪Fate holds us apart♪

00:17:14.298 --> 00:17:18.716
♪Stars stream in your eyes♪

00:17:19.049 --> 00:17:22.940
♪Intoxicated, I linger
and forget to return♪

00:17:24.882 --> 00:17:25.842
They're here.

00:17:31.322 --> 00:17:35.339
♪Temples await the moonlight's fall♪

00:17:35.612 --> 00:17:39.436
♪Time engraves into rings♪

00:17:40.154 --> 00:17:46.938
♪Slowly, we accompany the fading lights♪

00:17:51.162 --> 00:17:53.043
First bow to heaven and earth.

00:18:05.322 --> 00:18:07.243
Second bow to the seniors.

00:18:13.122 --> 00:18:14.602
Third bow to each other.

00:18:25.602 --> 00:18:26.842
The ceremony is complete.

00:18:27.443 --> 00:18:28.283
Congratulations.

00:18:28.283 --> 00:18:29.243
Thank you.

00:18:29.923 --> 00:18:30.882
Congratulations.

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:34.043
(Happiness)

00:18:34.043 --> 00:18:36.082
- Congratulations.
- Thank you.

00:18:56.842 --> 00:18:58.483
From now on,

00:18:58.963 --> 00:19:01.642
you two must cherish each other.

00:19:01.763 --> 00:19:02.882
Don't...

00:19:04.082 --> 00:19:06.203
Master, don't cry.

00:19:06.362 --> 00:19:07.763
I'm just getting married.

00:19:07.763 --> 00:19:09.483
I'll always be your disciple.

00:19:09.683 --> 00:19:10.723
Qiyue Peak

00:19:10.723 --> 00:19:11.842
will always be my home.

00:19:11.842 --> 00:19:14.043
Why would I cry?

00:19:14.523 --> 00:19:16.523
It's just that I've aged.

00:19:16.523 --> 00:19:17.322
My eyes

00:19:17.322 --> 00:19:19.322
keep getting dust in them.

00:19:19.322 --> 00:19:20.362
This joyous day

00:19:20.362 --> 00:19:21.562
calls for celebration.

00:19:21.562 --> 00:19:23.243
Why would I cry?

00:19:23.683 --> 00:19:25.562
Senior, rest assured.

00:19:25.683 --> 00:19:26.963
I'll take care of her.

00:19:27.443 --> 00:19:29.602
If I ever find out

00:19:29.602 --> 00:19:31.882
that you've bullied our Kong Hou,

00:19:31.882 --> 00:19:32.963
I'll make you pay dearly.

00:19:32.963 --> 00:19:34.003
Master.

00:19:34.402 --> 00:19:35.443
He is now

00:19:35.443 --> 00:19:37.122
my lawfully wedded husband.

00:19:37.122 --> 00:19:39.162
Please stop bullying him.

00:19:40.043 --> 00:19:40.882
Wang Tong.

00:19:41.562 --> 00:19:43.122
Your little disciple

00:19:43.243 --> 00:19:44.723
has just gotten married

00:19:44.723 --> 00:19:46.362
and is already defending her husband.

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:13.888
(Happiness)

00:20:22.523 --> 00:20:24.963
(What's taking Zhong Xi so long?)

00:20:26.802 --> 00:20:29.483
(I bet Lin Hu and Tan Feng
dragged him away)

00:20:29.602 --> 00:20:31.082
(for a few drinks.)

00:20:34.082 --> 00:20:34.963
Zhong Xi.

00:20:35.963 --> 00:20:37.082
You're back.

00:20:48.523 --> 00:20:49.602
It's you.

00:20:55.683 --> 00:20:57.483
Why was I not invited

00:20:57.642 --> 00:20:59.162
to such a joyous occasion?

00:20:59.283 --> 00:21:00.483
Why did you come?

00:21:02.003 --> 00:21:03.203
Don't worry.

00:21:03.602 --> 00:21:06.443
I'm not here for vengeance this time.

00:21:07.683 --> 00:21:09.122
I came for you.

00:21:09.523 --> 00:21:10.802
For me?

00:21:11.003 --> 00:21:12.322
What do you want?

00:21:12.963 --> 00:21:13.923
Kong Hou.

00:21:14.443 --> 00:21:16.322
Do you remember

00:21:16.483 --> 00:21:17.763
this phoenix mark?

00:21:18.203 --> 00:21:20.642
Phoenix mark?

00:21:20.842 --> 00:21:21.923
Today,

00:21:22.483 --> 00:21:24.122
I'll bring my little sister home.

00:21:24.842 --> 00:21:27.122
Don't talk nonsense!

00:21:28.802 --> 00:21:30.243
I'm serious.

00:21:30.402 --> 00:21:31.882
This is the Yueluo Clan's emblem.

00:21:32.082 --> 00:21:33.602
We're blood siblings.

00:21:40.723 --> 00:21:41.763
Jiusu.

00:21:42.003 --> 00:21:42.842
Kong Hou.

00:21:44.802 --> 00:21:45.642
Zhong Xi.

00:21:47.243 --> 00:21:48.122
Are you alright?

00:21:48.122 --> 00:21:49.082
I'm fine.

00:21:49.562 --> 00:21:50.443
Jiusu.

00:21:50.923 --> 00:21:52.243
What do you want?

00:21:52.402 --> 00:21:54.362
I don't want to fight you today,

00:21:54.523 --> 00:21:55.882
but Kong Hou

00:21:56.003 --> 00:21:57.322
must come with me.

00:21:57.322 --> 00:21:58.203
No way.

00:21:58.443 --> 00:22:00.082
Won't you even ask me

00:22:00.562 --> 00:22:02.162
why I'm taking Kong Hou away?

00:22:02.402 --> 00:22:04.562
You must've known about

00:22:04.562 --> 00:22:05.882
her true identity all along.

00:22:08.986 --> 00:22:11.066
(Record of Washed Grievances)

00:22:17.842 --> 00:22:18.763
Zhong Xi,

00:22:19.362 --> 00:22:20.642
what is he talking about?

00:22:22.683 --> 00:22:23.602
Kong Hou,

00:22:23.842 --> 00:22:25.082
we are both descendants

00:22:25.283 --> 00:22:26.483
of the Yueluo Clan.

00:22:26.963 --> 00:22:28.203
The so-called clan

00:22:28.203 --> 00:22:29.243
of dark cultivators.

00:22:29.362 --> 00:22:30.443
Don't talk nonsense.

00:22:31.122 --> 00:22:32.362
Our parents,

00:22:32.523 --> 00:22:33.923
siblings, and clansmen

00:22:34.162 --> 00:22:35.043
were slaughtered

00:22:35.043 --> 00:22:36.483
by these righteous cultivators.

00:22:36.642 --> 00:22:38.243
Will you still marry him?

00:22:38.402 --> 00:22:39.483
If you don't leave now,

00:22:39.683 --> 00:22:41.003
I'll be forced to act.

00:22:41.203 --> 00:22:42.043
Kong Hou.

00:22:42.203 --> 00:22:43.602
If you still have doubts,

00:22:43.763 --> 00:22:45.283
I'll prove it to you.

00:22:45.723 --> 00:22:47.483
Let me lift the seal on you.

00:22:47.562 --> 00:22:49.283
And you will learn the truth.

00:22:58.362 --> 00:22:59.082
(His cultivation)

00:22:59.082 --> 00:23:00.562
(advanced so fast?)

00:23:03.043 --> 00:23:04.043
Kong Hou.

00:23:07.763 --> 00:23:09.842
Kong Hou, don't be afraid.

00:23:10.283 --> 00:23:12.082
Whether you distrust me

00:23:12.243 --> 00:23:13.802
or refuse to accept the truth,

00:23:14.362 --> 00:23:16.122
the seal has been removed.

00:23:16.362 --> 00:23:18.082
Kong Hou, you saw it.

00:23:18.203 --> 00:23:19.642
That was Mother's phoenix mark.

00:23:21.483 --> 00:23:22.402
Do not listen

00:23:22.402 --> 00:23:23.723
to a single word he says.

00:23:25.642 --> 00:23:26.523
So,

00:23:27.923 --> 00:23:29.963
I had no spiritual root all these years

00:23:30.923 --> 00:23:33.243
because my power had been sealed?

00:23:37.763 --> 00:23:38.882
Jiusu.

00:23:41.003 --> 00:23:42.322
Everyone's here.

00:23:42.602 --> 00:23:43.923
Why don't you ask them

00:23:44.203 --> 00:23:46.283
whether you're my sister

00:23:46.443 --> 00:23:47.443
and the daughter

00:23:47.443 --> 00:23:49.402
of our late Sovereign Rong Ji?

00:23:49.402 --> 00:23:50.763
Stop talking nonsense!

00:23:50.802 --> 00:23:52.562
Am I talking nonsense,

00:23:52.723 --> 00:23:54.443
or are you hiding something?

00:23:55.043 --> 00:23:56.122
Master.

00:23:57.283 --> 00:23:58.362
Don't tell me

00:23:59.043 --> 00:24:00.882
you were the one who sealed my power.

00:24:02.003 --> 00:24:03.122
Master Wang Tong.

00:24:04.122 --> 00:24:05.483
Isn't my sister

00:24:05.642 --> 00:24:08.082
a natural prodigy in cultivation?

00:24:09.243 --> 00:24:11.602
Don't force me to make a move.

00:24:13.483 --> 00:24:15.802
Why are you so enraged?

00:24:15.963 --> 00:24:17.082
Truth be told,

00:24:17.243 --> 00:24:18.362
you raised and educated

00:24:18.362 --> 00:24:20.283
my sister Kong Hou all these years.

00:24:20.483 --> 00:24:21.842
I must thank you

00:24:22.003 --> 00:24:23.402
on behalf of our parents

00:24:23.562 --> 00:24:24.802
and our entire clan.

00:24:24.963 --> 00:24:26.043
Don't talk nonsense.

00:24:26.162 --> 00:24:27.162
The dark cultivation

00:24:27.162 --> 00:24:28.243
damaged your brain?

00:24:28.243 --> 00:24:29.602
Don't pester Kong Hou.

00:24:29.602 --> 00:24:30.203
She grew up

00:24:30.203 --> 00:24:31.362
in the Yunhua Sect

00:24:31.362 --> 00:24:32.203
under my watch.

00:24:32.203 --> 00:24:32.763
Exactly.

00:24:32.763 --> 00:24:33.963
She never left Yong City

00:24:33.963 --> 00:24:35.362
before she turned seventeen.

00:24:35.362 --> 00:24:36.683
She's not a dark cultivator.

00:24:36.683 --> 00:24:38.362
You're clearly here to cause trouble.

00:24:38.523 --> 00:24:41.283
Facts aren't established

00:24:41.283 --> 00:24:42.203
through empty words.

00:24:45.243 --> 00:24:45.963
Kong Hou.

00:24:46.122 --> 00:24:47.203
- Kong Hou.
- Kong Hou.

00:25:01.243 --> 00:25:03.402
Kong Hou, your identity
as a dark cultivator

00:25:03.402 --> 00:25:04.203
is now revealed.

00:25:04.523 --> 00:25:06.122
Even if you don't come with me today,

00:25:06.243 --> 00:25:07.162
eventually

00:25:07.362 --> 00:25:09.162
the Ten Great Sects will expel you.

00:25:09.602 --> 00:25:10.923
One day,

00:25:10.923 --> 00:25:11.683
you'll willingly

00:25:11.683 --> 00:25:12.802
come to your brother.

00:25:16.763 --> 00:25:17.723
Kong Hou.

00:25:39.003 --> 00:25:39.882
The bride.

00:25:39.882 --> 00:25:41.043
- Look.
- The bride is...

00:25:41.043 --> 00:25:42.523
She's a dark cultivator.

00:25:42.723 --> 00:25:43.683
Don't let her escape.

00:25:43.683 --> 00:25:44.723
Nobody moves.

00:25:52.642 --> 00:25:53.882
- Kong Hou.
- Kong Hou.

00:26:02.162 --> 00:26:04.562
I personally brought my disciple

00:26:04.562 --> 00:26:06.963
from the mortal realm
to the Yunhua Sect.

00:26:07.082 --> 00:26:08.283
I know her

00:26:08.283 --> 00:26:10.203
better than anyone.

00:26:10.443 --> 00:26:12.802
No more excuses.

00:26:12.802 --> 00:26:14.443
So many people

00:26:14.443 --> 00:26:15.162
witnessed

00:26:15.162 --> 00:26:16.723
the entire incident.

00:26:16.723 --> 00:26:19.162
We're not punishing you
for harboring evil yet.

00:26:19.362 --> 00:26:21.043
So stop being argumentative.

00:26:21.043 --> 00:26:21.963
While Kong Hou

00:26:22.122 --> 00:26:24.283
has kinship with that dark cultivator,

00:26:24.283 --> 00:26:25.082
she's been raised

00:26:25.082 --> 00:26:26.362
within the Yunhua Sect

00:26:26.362 --> 00:26:27.842
and has never practiced dark arts.

00:26:27.923 --> 00:26:28.723
This truth

00:26:28.842 --> 00:26:30.483
I swear before all sect leaders

00:26:30.683 --> 00:26:31.483
and masters

00:26:31.723 --> 00:26:32.642
with certainty.

00:26:32.923 --> 00:26:34.602
We naturally trust your word,

00:26:34.763 --> 00:26:36.362
Master Heng Yan.

00:26:36.642 --> 00:26:39.642
But this child
isn't an ordinary dark cultivator.

00:26:39.842 --> 00:26:41.882
When the seal broke earlier,

00:26:41.882 --> 00:26:43.763
many sect disciples were injured.

00:26:43.923 --> 00:26:45.642
Everyone has seen it.

00:26:50.483 --> 00:26:52.203
Sect leaders and masters.

00:26:52.402 --> 00:26:53.723
Disciples injured by Kong Hou

00:26:53.723 --> 00:26:54.723
from all the sects

00:26:54.723 --> 00:26:55.443
have been

00:26:55.523 --> 00:26:56.562
taken care of.

00:26:57.243 --> 00:26:58.082
Alright.

00:27:00.923 --> 00:27:03.602
Though Kong Hou
never practiced dark arts

00:27:03.602 --> 00:27:04.642
and only hurt others

00:27:04.642 --> 00:27:05.882
by mistake,

00:27:05.882 --> 00:27:07.122
she still carries

00:27:07.122 --> 00:27:08.763
the bloodline of dark cultivators.

00:27:08.923 --> 00:27:10.043
Moreover, she inherited

00:27:10.043 --> 00:27:11.322
Rong Ji's Five Spiritual Roots.

00:27:11.443 --> 00:27:13.162
If Jiusu lures her

00:27:13.322 --> 00:27:15.082
into avenging her father,

00:27:15.082 --> 00:27:16.683
they will come after all of you

00:27:16.683 --> 00:27:17.723
because you have

00:27:17.723 --> 00:27:19.763
suppressed the dark cultivators.

00:27:19.763 --> 00:27:21.043
Even if you join hands,

00:27:21.443 --> 00:27:23.723
you might not be able to take them down.

00:27:23.882 --> 00:27:25.043
Master.

00:27:26.842 --> 00:27:28.723
This matter arose abruptly,

00:27:28.723 --> 00:27:30.082
shrouded in doubt.

00:27:30.243 --> 00:27:31.523
Let's not act hastily.

00:27:31.523 --> 00:27:33.283
We'll discuss proper handling

00:27:33.283 --> 00:27:34.763
after a thorough investigation.

00:27:34.923 --> 00:27:36.082
I hope the Liuguang Sect

00:27:36.082 --> 00:27:36.602
won't be

00:27:36.602 --> 00:27:38.802
biased when Master Zhong Xi

00:27:39.523 --> 00:27:41.203
is involved.

00:27:41.203 --> 00:27:43.082
What makes you say that?

00:27:43.082 --> 00:27:44.082
I'm just saying

00:27:44.082 --> 00:27:45.642
that we must investigate

00:27:45.642 --> 00:27:46.402
thoroughly first.

00:27:46.402 --> 00:27:47.562
Master Heng Yan,

00:27:47.562 --> 00:27:48.723
please see the big picture.

00:27:48.723 --> 00:27:50.283
Master Heng Yan,

00:27:50.283 --> 00:27:51.602
please see the big picture.

00:27:51.602 --> 00:27:53.562
All of you, shut up.

00:27:53.562 --> 00:27:54.882
You think I don't know

00:27:54.963 --> 00:27:56.082
your true intentions?

00:27:56.082 --> 00:27:57.723
See the big picture?

00:27:57.882 --> 00:27:59.683
Must I spell out your hypocrisy?

00:27:59.683 --> 00:28:00.763
I don't wish to bring up

00:28:00.842 --> 00:28:02.003
that incident.

00:28:02.003 --> 00:28:03.322
But I'm warning you.

00:28:03.483 --> 00:28:04.602
If you dare lay a finger

00:28:04.602 --> 00:28:06.602
on my disciple Kong Hou,

00:28:06.602 --> 00:28:07.602
I'll make you pay

00:28:07.602 --> 00:28:08.763
at all costs.

00:28:08.763 --> 00:28:11.283
Master Wang Tong, don't forget that

00:28:11.483 --> 00:28:12.723
she's a dark cultivator.

00:28:12.723 --> 00:28:13.802
No, she's not

00:28:13.802 --> 00:28:14.802
because she doesn't

00:28:14.802 --> 00:28:16.122
practice dark arts.

00:28:16.122 --> 00:28:17.443
Since Master Heng Yan lacks

00:28:17.443 --> 00:28:18.362
the resolve to act,

00:28:18.362 --> 00:28:21.162
we petition Master Jin Yue to apprehend

00:28:21.322 --> 00:28:22.723
this dark cultivator

00:28:22.723 --> 00:28:24.443
on behalf of the Ten Great Sects.

00:28:28.842 --> 00:28:29.602
No.

00:28:31.243 --> 00:28:32.322
Master Jin Yue.

00:28:32.523 --> 00:28:33.602
Liuguang Sect has always

00:28:33.602 --> 00:28:35.203
upheld absolute justice.

00:28:35.203 --> 00:28:36.243
Days ago,

00:28:36.243 --> 00:28:37.322
Luanfeng Peak disciples

00:28:37.322 --> 00:28:38.923
saved countless disciples of mine.

00:28:38.923 --> 00:28:40.402
For this I'm grateful.

00:28:40.602 --> 00:28:41.963
Yet today, to my dismay,

00:28:42.162 --> 00:28:43.003
you let

00:28:43.003 --> 00:28:44.562
your affection for your disciple

00:28:44.802 --> 00:28:46.602
cloud your judgment.

00:28:46.802 --> 00:28:47.923
Our Liuguang Sect

00:28:47.923 --> 00:28:50.203
upholds absolute justice.

00:28:50.402 --> 00:28:52.043
We won't go after someone

00:28:52.443 --> 00:28:54.043
who has done nothing wrong.

00:28:54.243 --> 00:28:55.003
Very well.

00:28:55.763 --> 00:28:57.162
If Liuguang Sect

00:28:57.162 --> 00:28:58.003
and Yunhua Sect both

00:28:58.003 --> 00:28:59.723
shield this dark cultivator,

00:28:59.923 --> 00:29:01.203
I'll make the command.

00:29:01.362 --> 00:29:02.763
Arrest her at Qiyue Peak.

00:29:02.763 --> 00:29:03.802
Head of Jiufeng Sect,

00:29:04.443 --> 00:29:06.003
do you think Master Jin Yue

00:29:06.003 --> 00:29:07.483
and Master Heng Yan

00:29:07.683 --> 00:29:09.283
will let you capture Kong Hou?

00:29:14.723 --> 00:29:15.602
We'd better

00:29:15.602 --> 00:29:17.082
avoid unnecessary conflict.

00:29:17.082 --> 00:29:18.162
I have a solution

00:29:18.402 --> 00:29:19.882
that might resolve this.

00:29:35.162 --> 00:29:37.082
Stay outside.

00:29:37.322 --> 00:29:38.683
My disciple Kong Hou

00:29:38.683 --> 00:29:40.043
has suffered enough trauma.

00:29:40.043 --> 00:29:41.642
I must comfort her.

00:29:41.882 --> 00:29:42.763
Wang Tong.

00:29:43.322 --> 00:29:44.923
See the bigger picture.

00:29:48.122 --> 00:29:48.882
Wang Tong,

00:29:48.882 --> 00:29:50.082
wait here with me.

00:29:53.082 --> 00:29:53.923
Song He.

00:29:53.923 --> 00:29:55.082
Let go.

00:29:55.082 --> 00:29:56.243
I must keep her company.

00:29:56.963 --> 00:29:58.763
You might be too impulsive.

00:29:58.763 --> 00:30:00.923
We need to handle it rationally.

00:30:00.923 --> 00:30:02.683
I'm perfectly rational.

00:30:02.683 --> 00:30:03.562
In my younger days,

00:30:03.562 --> 00:30:04.443
I would've

00:30:04.443 --> 00:30:06.162
beaten those people long ago.

00:30:06.162 --> 00:30:08.362
Every one of them
speaks about righteousness,

00:30:08.362 --> 00:30:09.362
but none of them

00:30:09.362 --> 00:30:11.763
truly cares about my disciple

00:30:11.763 --> 00:30:13.443
Kong Hou's life.

00:30:14.723 --> 00:30:16.923
Master, what brings you here?

00:30:17.003 --> 00:30:19.162
Master Heng Yan, Master Jin Yue.

00:30:27.802 --> 00:30:28.723
Kong Hou.

00:30:28.923 --> 00:30:30.842
To spare your life, the sect leaders

00:30:31.043 --> 00:30:32.523
decided that we must

00:30:33.003 --> 00:30:35.082
extract your Five Spiritual Roots

00:30:35.283 --> 00:30:36.882
and purge your cultivation.

00:30:36.882 --> 00:30:38.043
What?

00:30:38.842 --> 00:30:40.162
Only then

00:30:40.162 --> 00:30:40.963
would they

00:30:40.963 --> 00:30:43.122
let you stay at the Yunhua Sect.

00:30:44.362 --> 00:30:45.362
I refuse.

00:30:46.043 --> 00:30:47.963
Extract her roots
and purge her cultivation?

00:30:47.963 --> 00:30:50.003
A minor mistake could kill her.

00:30:50.203 --> 00:30:52.003
Kong Hou did nothing wrong.

00:30:52.203 --> 00:30:53.362
Why should she suffer?

00:30:53.362 --> 00:30:54.122
I won't allow it.

00:30:54.283 --> 00:30:56.003
Wang Tong,

00:30:56.162 --> 00:30:57.283
Zhong Xi is inside.

00:30:57.283 --> 00:30:58.802
Surely you trust him?

00:30:58.802 --> 00:31:00.882
He'll protect Kong Hou.

00:31:01.283 --> 00:31:02.562
If something happens,

00:31:02.562 --> 00:31:04.842
we'll intervene immediately.

00:31:05.003 --> 00:31:06.483
You have a point.

00:31:08.162 --> 00:31:10.203
Why did you agree so suddenly?

00:31:10.763 --> 00:31:11.642
Does it feel sudden?

00:31:11.882 --> 00:31:12.683
I came around it.

00:31:12.683 --> 00:31:15.082
Clarity can come in an instant.

00:31:15.283 --> 00:31:16.402
Wang Tong.

00:31:16.642 --> 00:31:18.602
You were charging in just now

00:31:18.723 --> 00:31:20.923
but gave up so easily.

00:31:21.523 --> 00:31:22.842
Something's off.

00:31:23.043 --> 00:31:23.763
Really?

00:31:24.122 --> 00:31:25.122
I don't think so.

00:31:25.523 --> 00:31:26.802
Stay right here

00:31:26.802 --> 00:31:28.203
and wait for them.

00:31:28.322 --> 00:31:30.402
I'll return to my abode to rest.

00:31:30.402 --> 00:31:32.443
I stayed up all night. I'm exhausted.

00:31:35.162 --> 00:31:37.243
What scheme are you plotting?

00:31:37.683 --> 00:31:38.923
Listen.

00:31:38.923 --> 00:31:40.723
Don't act recklessly.

00:31:40.723 --> 00:31:42.802
People are watching you.

00:31:43.043 --> 00:31:43.963
Exactly.

00:31:43.963 --> 00:31:45.322
What could I possibly do?

00:31:45.322 --> 00:31:47.562
People are watching me.

00:31:49.483 --> 00:31:50.882
You're acting strange.

00:31:51.402 --> 00:31:52.683
Something's wrong.

00:31:52.923 --> 00:31:55.443
You're being paranoid.

00:31:57.402 --> 00:31:58.162
Wang Tong.

00:31:58.763 --> 00:32:00.082
Don't do anything foolish.

00:32:01.203 --> 00:32:02.283
None of your business.

00:32:05.842 --> 00:32:06.763
Zhong Xi.

00:32:07.562 --> 00:32:09.283
Kong Hou has unique spiritual roots.

00:32:09.283 --> 00:32:10.562
It is a tricky matter.

00:32:13.322 --> 00:32:14.162
This is

00:32:14.443 --> 00:32:17.562
the most viable solution for now.

00:32:18.003 --> 00:32:18.842
Master Heng Yan.

00:32:19.642 --> 00:32:20.683
I'm scared.

00:32:21.443 --> 00:32:23.322
Please don't remove my spiritual roots.

00:32:23.882 --> 00:32:24.882
Kong Hou.

00:32:25.882 --> 00:32:26.842
Don't be scared.

00:32:27.043 --> 00:32:28.882
No one can hurt you while I'm here.

00:32:30.283 --> 00:32:32.043
If the Yunhua Sect can't shelter you,

00:32:32.443 --> 00:32:33.882
I'll take you somewhere else.

00:32:34.322 --> 00:32:36.402
If the Lingyou Realm rejects you,

00:32:36.683 --> 00:32:38.362
we'll go to another realm.

00:32:38.683 --> 00:32:40.882
Zhong Xi, don't be impulsive.

00:32:40.882 --> 00:32:42.322
I'm not being impulsive, Master.

00:32:42.483 --> 00:32:43.483
I mean every word.

00:32:43.842 --> 00:32:45.122
Let me repeat myself.

00:32:45.642 --> 00:32:46.683
No one can hurt her

00:32:46.802 --> 00:32:48.362
while I'm here.

00:32:56.523 --> 00:32:58.283
Get that dark cultivator.

00:33:03.562 --> 00:33:04.642
Stop her.

00:33:20.162 --> 00:33:22.362
Such arrogance
from a mere dark cultivator.

00:33:22.562 --> 00:33:24.043
Return with me at once.

00:33:26.162 --> 00:33:27.322
Why are you

00:33:27.322 --> 00:33:28.203
arresting me?

00:33:28.203 --> 00:33:29.683
I didn't do anything.

00:33:39.203 --> 00:33:41.523
Typical vile dark cultivator tactics.

00:33:41.842 --> 00:33:43.003
Let us out now.

00:33:43.003 --> 00:33:43.723
If any of you

00:33:43.723 --> 00:33:45.203
dare slander my disciple again,

00:33:45.203 --> 00:33:45.802
I swear

00:33:45.802 --> 00:33:47.043
I'll bury you right there.

00:33:47.402 --> 00:33:48.483
What's happening?

00:33:48.483 --> 00:33:50.683
Why does she sound like that?

00:33:56.842 --> 00:33:58.523
Look at you.

00:33:58.523 --> 00:33:59.523
A concealment spell

00:33:59.523 --> 00:34:01.082
has you trembling like rabbits.

00:34:10.602 --> 00:34:12.202
You guys, search over there.

00:34:12.202 --> 00:34:12.762
Understood.

00:34:22.043 --> 00:34:23.363
We should be safe now.

00:34:26.202 --> 00:34:27.043
Zhong Xi.

00:34:29.403 --> 00:34:31.803
We finally got out.

00:34:31.803 --> 00:34:33.003
Thank you, Lady Ling Bo.

00:34:33.003 --> 00:34:33.963
Don't mention it.

00:34:34.162 --> 00:34:35.122
I can discern

00:34:35.122 --> 00:34:36.242
right from wrong.

00:34:36.523 --> 00:34:37.523
Young Master, Kong Hou.

00:34:37.523 --> 00:34:38.323
Hurry up.

00:34:38.363 --> 00:34:39.523
Ling Bo and I will stay

00:34:39.523 --> 00:34:40.202
just in case.

00:34:40.202 --> 00:34:41.443
Lady Ling Bo.

00:34:41.843 --> 00:34:43.363
Thank you for your help.

00:34:44.003 --> 00:34:44.762
Take care.

00:34:55.963 --> 00:34:57.082
- What are you...
- What are you...

00:34:59.043 --> 00:35:00.043
You go first.

00:35:01.403 --> 00:35:02.602
I'm going to

00:35:02.602 --> 00:35:04.523
regroup with our sect members

00:35:04.523 --> 00:35:07.162
and keep "searching" for them

00:35:07.162 --> 00:35:08.803
as if I don't know where they are.

00:35:09.682 --> 00:35:10.282
Nice plan.

00:35:10.523 --> 00:35:12.162
Put on a full play

00:35:12.883 --> 00:35:15.082
to avoid suspicion. Well considered.

00:35:15.282 --> 00:35:16.122
What about you?

00:35:16.122 --> 00:35:17.242
What will you do?

00:35:17.443 --> 00:35:19.242
Me? I...

00:35:19.242 --> 00:35:20.242
I'm going back.

00:35:20.242 --> 00:35:21.122
Going back?

00:35:21.122 --> 00:35:22.323
No, you can't.

00:35:22.323 --> 00:35:23.363
If you go back,

00:35:23.363 --> 00:35:24.443
all those cultivators

00:35:24.443 --> 00:35:25.803
will be watching you.

00:35:25.803 --> 00:35:26.923
Why don't you

00:35:27.043 --> 00:35:28.122
come with me

00:35:28.122 --> 00:35:29.122
to "search" for them

00:35:29.122 --> 00:35:30.242
and buy them some time?

00:35:31.043 --> 00:35:31.803
Given my tie

00:35:31.803 --> 00:35:33.242
with Young Master,

00:35:33.242 --> 00:35:34.602
whether I return or not,

00:35:34.602 --> 00:35:35.242
our sect leader

00:35:35.242 --> 00:35:36.523
will suspect me.

00:35:36.523 --> 00:35:38.003
I might as well return early

00:35:38.003 --> 00:35:40.282
to divert attention
from Young Master and Kong Hou.

00:35:40.282 --> 00:35:41.843
Isn't it better?

00:35:42.843 --> 00:35:43.722
That makes sense.

00:35:45.523 --> 00:35:47.562
If they press you about

00:35:47.562 --> 00:35:49.562
Master Zhong Xi
and Kong Hou's whereabouts,

00:35:49.562 --> 00:35:50.323
what will you say?

00:35:50.323 --> 00:35:52.602
I-I'll just ramble nonsense.

00:35:52.602 --> 00:35:53.202
I'll claim

00:35:53.202 --> 00:35:54.242
that Young Master went

00:35:54.242 --> 00:35:54.803
up and down,

00:35:54.803 --> 00:35:55.843
east and west,

00:35:55.843 --> 00:35:56.883
or vanished completely.

00:35:56.883 --> 00:35:58.722
Whether they believe it
is their problem.

00:35:58.722 --> 00:35:59.602
If they

00:35:59.602 --> 00:36:01.443
actually discover his trail,

00:36:01.443 --> 00:36:02.803
I'll learn about it first

00:36:02.803 --> 00:36:04.323
and warn Young Master and Kong Hou.

00:36:04.323 --> 00:36:05.483
That's more useful.

00:36:05.483 --> 00:36:06.562
Don't worry.

00:36:06.562 --> 00:36:08.043
I'll manage.

00:36:09.403 --> 00:36:09.963
Alright.

00:36:10.883 --> 00:36:11.963
Then

00:36:15.403 --> 00:36:16.682
be careful.

00:36:22.082 --> 00:36:23.803
Y-You should stay safe too.

00:36:23.803 --> 00:36:24.602
Alright.

00:36:27.642 --> 00:36:28.483
Be careful.

00:36:29.282 --> 00:36:30.923
Wang Tong.

00:36:31.122 --> 00:36:32.722
I knew you were up to something.

00:36:32.722 --> 00:36:34.282
You vanished in a blink.

00:36:34.282 --> 00:36:35.242
I couldn't catch you.

00:36:35.483 --> 00:36:36.843
You couldn't catch me

00:36:36.843 --> 00:36:38.162
because you were less skilled.

00:36:38.162 --> 00:36:39.562
Stop whining about it.

00:36:39.562 --> 00:36:40.363
Yeah.

00:36:40.363 --> 00:36:41.562
You're more skilled.

00:36:41.562 --> 00:36:43.363
But you're audaciously reckless.

00:36:43.363 --> 00:36:45.082
How dare you harbor Kong Hou?

00:36:45.082 --> 00:36:46.963
My disciple did nothing wrong.

00:36:46.963 --> 00:36:48.323
What do you mean by "harbor"?

00:36:48.602 --> 00:36:50.363
They wanted to pierce her bones

00:36:50.443 --> 00:36:51.523
and strip her tendons.

00:36:51.523 --> 00:36:53.403
Could I just let it happen?

00:36:53.403 --> 00:36:55.082
Especially when she's innocent!

00:36:55.082 --> 00:36:56.323
Even if she were guilty,

00:36:56.323 --> 00:36:57.282
could I just sit back

00:36:57.282 --> 00:36:58.602
and let them hurt her?

00:36:58.803 --> 00:36:59.923
Wang Tong.

00:37:00.242 --> 00:37:01.963
Kong Hou is a dark cultivator.

00:37:01.963 --> 00:37:02.803
We're doing this

00:37:02.803 --> 00:37:04.403
to prevent future problems.

00:37:04.403 --> 00:37:05.642
She'd lose her spiritual roots,

00:37:05.642 --> 00:37:07.242
but she'd be alive.

00:37:07.443 --> 00:37:08.883
This is for her own good.

00:37:08.883 --> 00:37:10.923
"A commoner's no criminal
until his treasure

00:37:10.923 --> 00:37:12.162
invites trouble."

00:37:12.162 --> 00:37:13.043
Blame it on fate

00:37:13.043 --> 00:37:15.682
that she was born a dark cultivator.

00:37:15.682 --> 00:37:17.682
Morality isn't determined

00:37:17.682 --> 00:37:18.642
by one's origins.

00:37:18.642 --> 00:37:20.003
I know my disciple

00:37:20.003 --> 00:37:21.363
better than anyone.

00:37:21.363 --> 00:37:22.562
Her treasure invites trouble?

00:37:22.562 --> 00:37:23.483
Take you, for example.

00:37:23.483 --> 00:37:24.682
Your mother wanted

00:37:24.682 --> 00:37:25.682
a daughter

00:37:25.682 --> 00:37:26.242
but gave birth

00:37:26.242 --> 00:37:27.282
to a brat like you.

00:37:27.282 --> 00:37:28.003
Who should

00:37:28.003 --> 00:37:28.843
she blame?

00:37:28.843 --> 00:37:30.242
How is that fair?

00:37:30.242 --> 00:37:31.043
Of course,

00:37:31.043 --> 00:37:32.122
Kong Hou

00:37:32.122 --> 00:37:34.363
couldn't choose her origin, either.

00:37:34.363 --> 00:37:35.082
You...

00:37:37.003 --> 00:37:38.682
I won't waste my breath with you.

00:37:38.803 --> 00:37:39.883
Tell us.

00:37:39.883 --> 00:37:41.043
Where have you hidden

00:37:41.043 --> 00:37:42.162
your disciple?

00:37:42.363 --> 00:37:44.363
Out with it. Where is she?

00:37:47.403 --> 00:37:48.403
Master Jin Yue.

00:37:48.403 --> 00:37:49.642
Look at him.

00:37:49.803 --> 00:37:51.562
So obstinate.

00:37:51.562 --> 00:37:52.363
Perhaps

00:37:52.363 --> 00:37:54.323
he's done more than
shelter his disciple.

00:37:54.323 --> 00:37:55.323
All these years,

00:37:55.323 --> 00:37:56.562
he must've learned about

00:37:56.562 --> 00:37:57.483
her true identity.

00:37:57.762 --> 00:38:00.443
He might have even
colluded with the dark cultivators.

00:38:00.443 --> 00:38:01.403
No way.

00:38:01.803 --> 00:38:03.523
The entire Lingyou Realm knows

00:38:03.523 --> 00:38:05.682
that Wang Tong is ruthless against evil.

00:38:05.682 --> 00:38:06.523
He's just

00:38:07.003 --> 00:38:09.003
worried about his disciple.

00:38:10.562 --> 00:38:11.562
Heng Yan.

00:38:11.843 --> 00:38:13.363
You see what they are like.

00:38:13.363 --> 00:38:14.162
So abnoxious.

00:38:14.162 --> 00:38:15.843
Once they've decided something,

00:38:16.043 --> 00:38:17.562
no one can change their minds.

00:38:17.562 --> 00:38:19.323
I'll take full responsibility

00:38:19.323 --> 00:38:21.242
and won't drag
the Yunhua Sect into this.

00:38:21.242 --> 00:38:22.682
Whatever punishment you decide,

00:38:23.843 --> 00:38:25.403
I'll accept it.

00:38:25.562 --> 00:38:26.923
Punishment?

00:38:26.923 --> 00:38:28.363
How naive!

00:38:28.602 --> 00:38:30.162
You shall be executed today,

00:38:30.162 --> 00:38:31.483
or justice won't be served.

00:38:31.483 --> 00:38:32.523
Enough.

00:38:52.043 --> 00:38:53.003
Wang Tong.

00:38:53.202 --> 00:38:55.762
Where is Kong Hou?

00:38:56.202 --> 00:38:57.762
You old fool.

00:38:57.762 --> 00:38:58.363
We almost

00:38:58.363 --> 00:38:59.523
became in-laws.

00:38:59.523 --> 00:39:01.323
You suspect Kong Hou too, don't you?

00:39:01.323 --> 00:39:03.082
I only trust evidence.

00:39:03.282 --> 00:39:04.523
Bring Kong Hou back

00:39:04.562 --> 00:39:06.843
and extract her spiritual roots.

00:39:06.963 --> 00:39:09.323
That's how we truly help her.

00:39:11.242 --> 00:39:11.883
You...

00:39:13.082 --> 00:39:14.202
Stop arguing.

00:39:14.202 --> 00:39:14.963
In my opinion,

00:39:14.963 --> 00:39:16.403
we should dispose of him too.

00:39:16.562 --> 00:39:17.122
Yeah.

00:39:17.122 --> 00:39:19.523
Besides, the Yunhua Sect must also

00:39:19.523 --> 00:39:20.523
be held accountable.

00:39:20.562 --> 00:39:21.363
I say we should

00:39:21.363 --> 00:39:22.403
let them handle

00:39:22.403 --> 00:39:23.722
this rule-breaker themselves

00:39:24.202 --> 00:39:25.323
to prove their innocence.

00:39:31.122 --> 00:39:32.682
From your aggressive stance,

00:39:32.722 --> 00:39:35.003
if we don't execute Wang Tong here,

00:39:35.003 --> 00:39:36.363
you'll tear apart

00:39:36.363 --> 00:39:37.323
the Yunhua Sect.

00:39:37.323 --> 00:39:39.363
T-That's not what we meant.

00:39:39.363 --> 00:39:40.562
But Wang Tong...

00:39:42.642 --> 00:39:44.722
Wang Tong acted rashly, true.

00:39:45.762 --> 00:39:47.122
But we must look into

00:39:47.122 --> 00:39:48.562
Kong Hou's case.

00:39:48.883 --> 00:39:51.122
You can't just lose it

00:39:51.122 --> 00:39:52.642
and direct your fury

00:39:52.642 --> 00:39:54.122
at the Yunhua Sect.

00:39:54.602 --> 00:39:56.562
We'll accept due responsibility,

00:39:56.562 --> 00:39:59.562
but conclusions
require thorough investigation.

00:39:59.803 --> 00:40:00.642
Regarding Kong Hou,

00:40:00.642 --> 00:40:01.282
we will conduct

00:40:01.282 --> 00:40:02.682
investigations with you.

00:40:03.363 --> 00:40:04.803
As for Wang Tong,

00:40:05.282 --> 00:40:06.282
he'll face

00:40:06.282 --> 00:40:08.003
our disciplinary measures.

00:40:08.323 --> 00:40:10.923
You are welcome to oversee this process.

00:40:11.202 --> 00:40:12.523
The Yunhua Sect

00:40:12.523 --> 00:40:14.642
will never bend justice for anything.

00:40:47.987 --> 00:40:50.554
♪Roaming with the wind♪

00:40:50.999 --> 00:40:53.310
♪Wandering about♪

00:40:53.762 --> 00:40:58.573
♪A final ember of warmth abides♪

00:40:59.707 --> 00:41:01.873
♪Absurd plots unfold♪

00:41:02.349 --> 00:41:04.863
♪Mere spectators♪

00:41:05.127 --> 00:41:09.657
♪Footprints left on shores♪

00:41:10.992 --> 00:41:13.415
♪Fickle kisses burn♪

00:41:13.688 --> 00:41:16.480
♪Withering in an instant♪

00:41:16.595 --> 00:41:21.379
♪Lanterns glow, depicting her grace♪

00:41:22.258 --> 00:41:24.790
♪Like rusted locks♪

00:41:25.158 --> 00:41:27.759
♪Chaining our memories♪

00:41:28.089 --> 00:41:33.051
♪Only scars remain♪

00:41:33.395 --> 00:41:36.063
♪Breaking from worldly desires♪

00:41:36.275 --> 00:41:38.981
♪Dreams shattered, but reality rolls on♪

